Machine (static)

System utilities and program execution.

Methods:
  Help(className, show)       - Display help for classes/methods
  Vars()                      - List all variables
  Execute(path)               - Run code from a file path
  List(path)                  - List contents of a path
  Touch(path)                 - Create empty file at path
  Install(sourcePath, name)   - Install a program to bin